---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import canaliSocial from '../data/social.json';
---

<Layout title="I Social">
  <!-- HEADER DI PAGINA -->
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Canali Social Ufficiali</h1>
      <p>Rimani in contatto con Andrea Borello, partecipa alle discussioni e segui le attività quotidiane sui canali digitali.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container page-content">
    <!-- GRIGLIA PROFILI SOCIAL -->
    <div class="social-grid">
      {canaliSocial.map((social) => (
        <article class="social-card">
          <div class="social-card-top">
            <span class="social-icon" style={`color: ${social.colore};`}>{social.icona}</span>
            <span class="social-badge">{social.badge}</span>
          </div>

          <div class="social-info">
            <h2>{social.nome}</h2>
            <span class="social-handle">{social.handle}</span>
            <p class="social-desc">{social.descrizione}</p>
          </div>

          <a 
            href={social.url} 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="social-btn"
          >
            Segui su {social.nome} &rarr;
          </a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- BOX PARTECIPAZIONE -->
    <section class="community-box">
      <h2>Entra nella community</h2>
      <p>
        Hai domande, segnalazioni sul tuo quartiere o idee da proporre? Scrivimi direttamente tramite i messaggi ufficiali sui canali social o partecipa nei commenti dei post. La partecipazione attiva è il primo passo per costruire insieme una politica migliore.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }

  /* Header della pagina */
  .page-header {
    background-color: #1f2937;
    color: white;
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 4px solid var(--pd-red);
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .page-header p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #d1d5db;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-content {
    padding-top: 3.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  /* Griglia Social */
  .social-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  /* Scheda singolo social */
  .social-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .social-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }

  .social-card-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .social-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
  }

  .social-badge {
    background-color: #f3f4f6;
    color: #4b5563;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .social-info h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .social-handle {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--pd-red);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .social-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .social-btn {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    background-color: #1f2937;
    color: white;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .social-btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--pd-red);
  }

  /* Box Community */
  .community-box {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-left: 6px solid var(--pd-red);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-right: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .community-box h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .community-box p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
</style>